acceptance_criteria: "Existing outbox inspection paths isolate unsafe native counters per record, return bounded safe reasons, preserve healthy receipts and all persisted bytes, and never authorize delivery from malformed proof. Add real non-git SDK regressions and property tests for native integer extremes."
